-- Language — ISO 639-1 language with native name.
--
-- Reference rows live in language-data.fenel as per-row value-decls
-- (`language_en = Language {…}`), indexed under `Language` by the value-
-- registry loader and registered as global-scope by-type dispatch targets
-- (storage-as-effect Phase 3a — the retired setStaticData map + languages.ts
-- array). Identity and field facets are registered from Fenel directives.
--
-- Phase 3b of the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3b-system-entities-small-batch.md.
-- All three field labels use the UUID field facet fallback to a humanized
-- current Codeable, so this entity exercises the same humanize-clean recipe as the
-- Phase 3a Currency pilot.

@entity
@codeName "language"
@label "Language"
@description "ISO 639-1 language with native name"
@icon "languages"
Language = Language code: String name: String nativeName: String
